#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:5
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Dokumenti"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:9
msgid "You can store and share administrative documents from Galette, like statuses, meeting minutes, and so on."
msgstr ""
"U Galetteu možete spremati i dijeliti administrativne dokumente, primjerice "
"statut i zapisnike sastanaka."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:11
msgid "Documents list"
msgstr "Popis dokumenata"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:16
msgid "This is dispatched in two parts:"
msgstr "Podijeljeno je na dva dijela:"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:18
msgid "**Documents management**: where you can add, edit, and delete documents - available from Management, Documents menu;"
msgstr ""
"**Upravljanje dokumentima**: dodavanje, uređivanje i brisanje dokumenata, "
"dostupno putem Upravljanje, Dokumenti;"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:19
msgid "**Public list**: where documents can be seen - available from Public pages, Documents menu."
msgstr ""
"**Javni popis**: pregled dokumenata, dostupno putem Javne stranice, "
"Dokumenti."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:22
msgid "Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:24
msgid "Documents management list"
msgstr "Popis za upravljanje dokumentima"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:29
msgid "Add a document"
msgstr "Dodavanje dokumenta"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:34
msgid "The list can be filtered on the creation date, the filename, the type and the visibility of the documents. Click on **Filter** to apply the filters, and on **Clear filter** to come back to the whole list. When there are many documents, the list is displayed on several pages."
msgstr ""
"Popis se može filtrirati prema datumu stvaranja, nazivu datoteke, vrsti i "
"vidljivosti dokumenata. Kliknite **Filtriraj** za primjenu, a **Ukloni "
"filtar** za cijeli popis. Ako ima mnogo dokumenata, popis se prikazuje na "
"više stranica."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:36
msgid "Filtering the documents list"
msgstr "Filtriranje popisa dokumenata"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:41
msgid "When creating or editing a document, you will of course choose a file to upload, a document type and a permission."
msgstr ""
"Pri stvaranju ili uređivanju dokumenta odaberite datoteku za prijenos, vrstu "
"dokumenta i ovlasti."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:43
msgid "Several possible documents types are available from the list, you add a new one by just entering your text in the field."
msgstr ""
"Na popisu je dostupno više vrsta dokumenata. Novu možete dodati jednostavnim "
"unosom teksta u polje."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:45
msgid "Permissions will determine which documents will be displayed on public page; according to the user's rights."
msgstr ""
"Ovlasti određuju koji se dokumenti prikazuju na javnoj stranici, ovisno o "
"korisnikovim pravima."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:48
msgid "Public list"
msgstr "Javni popis"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:50
msgid "Documents public list is, as all public pages in Galette, related to \"Show public pages\" parameter from settings; but it's also related to specific access rights which has been set on each one."
msgstr ""
"Kao i sve javne stranice Galettea, javni popis dokumenata ovisi o postavci „"
"Prikaži javne stranice”, ali i o ovlastima dodijeljenima pojedinom dokumentu."

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:52
msgid "Documents list from a simple member"
msgstr "Popis dokumenata za običnog člana"

#: ../usermanual/documents.rst:57
msgid "On the above screenshot, a simple member is logged and can only see documents which are public and which are allowed for users. The internal document is restricted to staff members and therefore is not shown here."
msgstr ""
"Na gornjoj slici prijavljen je obični član. Vidi samo javne dokumente i one "
"dostupne korisnicima. Interni dokument namijenjen je upravi pa nije prikazan."
